  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>What might spell doom for one listener brings the greatest of joy to another.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fate sphere (Echoing Word [mass]), Mind sphere; or Fate sphere, Mind sphere (Mass Charm [mass]).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a charm, cloud, or word, you may spend 1 additional spell point to affect the target, targets, or creatures in the area with a different charm, cloud, or word you may create if they are of a certain alignment (designations may include specifications such as lawful good, any good, or any nongood). Creatures of that alignment are instead affected by a different charm or cloud effect of your choice of the same strength that you may create, or a word you may cast, chosen when you cast the first effect. You must spend spell points for the secondary effect as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fate#toc107\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
